  Changes Made:

  1. Updated src/model/cashu/tx-recovery.ts with:
    • Complete executeNutszapMeltStep() dispatcher function handling all 9 steps
    • executeGetMeltQuoteStep(): Gets mint quote from target mint, then melt quo
      rom source mint using the invoice
    • executePerformMeltStep(): Executes melt on source mint, stores change proo
    • executeGetMintQuoteStep(): Gets fresh mint quote from target mint
    • executePerformMintStep(): Polls for paid status (60 attempts, 2 min max),
      mints new proofs
    • executeBuildCrossMintNutszapEventStep(): Builds event using minted proofs
      target mint
    • executeFinalizeCrossMintStep(): Commits reserved proofs, saves change proo
      o wallet
  2. Added imports: MeltQuoteState and MintQuoteState from @cashu/cashu-ts
  3. Key patterns:
    • Cross-mint swap flow: Target mint quote → Source melt quote → Melt (pays i
      ce) → Poll target for PAID → Mint new proofs
    • All steps are idempotent - check state before executing
    • State persisted to IndexedDB after each step
    • Quote expiry checked before operations

